(b) Reproduce and use the Software solely for internal, non-commercial development
    within the authorized AevOS mesh environments.

3. RESTRICTIONS
You shall NOT, without explicit written consent from the Aevov Organization:
(a) Redistribute, sublicense, or sell the Software or any derivative works.
(b) Port, migrate, or adapt the Software to any non-AevOS kernels, including but not
    limited to the Linux Kernel or BSD-based systems.
(c) Modify the Software for use in production environments outside of the Aevov
    Sovereign Mesh.
(d) Use the Software in any commercial application or service.

4. SOVEREIGNTY & EXCLUSIVITY
The Software is intended to be a "Sovereign" implementation. Any attempt to decouple
the "Blackwell-QP" anyonic protocol or "Merkle-Shard" storage logic for use in
external, silicon-only operating systems is a violation of this License.

